FunctionEnd

; Pops a combobox index and pushes the matching language code (English when the
; index is unknown). Used when the language page is confirmed.
Function TactileLanguageCodeFromIndex
    Pop $1
    StrCpy $9 "en"
    StrCmp $1 0 0 +2
